===== Profit and Loss =======

1. Cost Price (CP) : Jis price pe item kharida.
CP=Buying Price

2. Selling Price (SP) : Jis price pe item becha.
SP=Selling Price

3. Profit / Loss
Profit: Agar: SP>CP
   Then: Profit=SP−CP
Loss: Agar: CP>SP
  Then: Loss=CP−SP

4.Profit Percentage
Profit%= Profit/cp x 100

5.Loss Percentage
Loss%= loss/cp x 100

6. Marked Price (MP) : Tag price.
Discount = Mp - SP
Discount % = Dicount/Mp x 100

